{"suttaId":"tha-ap434","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[578,616],"vripara":"13"},"segments":{"tha-ap434:0.3":"Ekasaṅkhiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap434:1.1":"“Vipassino bhagavato, mahābodhimaho ahu;","tha-ap434:1.3":"Mahājanā samāgamma, pūjenti bodhimuttamaṃ.","tha-ap434:2.1":"“Na hi taṃ orakaṃ maññe, buddhaseṭṭho bhavissati;","tha-ap434:2.3":"Yassāyaṃ īdisā bodhi, pūjanīyā [īdiso bodhi, pūjanīyo (syā.)] ca satthuno.","tha-ap434:3.1":"“Tato saṅkhaṃ gahetvāna, bodhirukkhamupaṭṭhahiṃ;","tha-ap434:3.3":"Dhamanto sabbadivasaṃ, avandiṃ bodhimuttamaṃ.","tha-ap434:4.1":"“Āsannake kataṃ kammaṃ, devalokaṃ apāpayī;","tha-ap434:4.3":"Kaḷevaraṃ me patitaṃ, devaloke ramāmahaṃ.","tha-ap434:5.1":"“Saṭṭhituriyasahassāni, tuṭṭhahaṭṭhā pamoditā;","tha-ap434:5.3":"Sadā mayhaṃ upaṭṭhanti, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap434:6.1":"“Ekasattatime kappe, rājā āsiṃ sudassano;","tha-ap434:6.3":"Cāturanto vijitāvī, jambumaṇḍassa issaro.","tha-ap434:7.1":"“Tato aṅgasatā turiyā [tūrā (sī. ka.)], parivārenti maṃ sadā;","tha-ap434:7.3":"Anubhomi sakaṃ kammaṃ, upaṭṭhānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap434:8.1":"“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;","tha-ap434:8.3":"Mātukucchigatassāpi, vajjare bheriyo sadā.","tha-ap434:9.1":"“Upaṭṭhitvāna sambuddhaṃ, anubhutvāna sampadā;","tha-ap434:9.3":"Sivaṃ sukhemaṃ amataṃ, pattomhi acalaṃ padaṃ.","tha-ap434:10.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ kammamakariṃ tadā;","tha-ap434:10.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap434:11.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap434:12.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap434:13.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap434:14.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ekasaṅkhiyo thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap434:15.1":"Ekasaṅkhiyattherassāpadānaṃ dutiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
